# state: any   (classifier-path benchmark opening; #433 step 6c)
# Spider-Man 2 (4156002B), classifier-path benchmark (#433): drive generic
# replaces the blind opening and marks gameplay itself once play is
# confirmed. Open-world action: run forward, turn, attack/jump -- never
# START. See pm/owner-holds.tsv spiderman2-below-bar (below_bar,
# PLAYABLE_ATTEMPT only -- does not block a benchmark fps read).
drive generic 300 mark
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 2.0
    axis LX max
    wait 1.0
    axis LX mid
    wait 1.0
    axis LX min
    wait 1.0
    axis LX mid
    mash A 2 0.3
    wait 1.5
}
